    <briefdescription>
<para>Tuple bloom filter. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Consists of a set of bloom filters, one per each partial key. When a key is checked to be hashed in the bloom, all its partial keys are checked as well, which lowers the probability of false positive results. </para>    </detaileddescription>
